      "en": "Large companies have **procurement**: approved vendors, 3 quotes, paperwork (commercial register, tax card, bank account), and 30–60-day payment terms. Ask early: «who signs? what are the vendor approval steps? what documents? this year’s budget?» so you are not surprised two months later."
